Subject: Manager Worker Projection Contracts V1
Date: 2026-05-26
Contract UUID: 54ce3936-4dd2-4323-9c63-fe80a141ce75

@ [slice_surface] docs/slices/FSC4_Final_Slices.v1.sop
@ [surface_boundary] docs/surfaces/FSC4_Surface_Boundary_And_Invariant_Map.v1.sop
@ [authority_notice_contract] docs/surfaces/Authority_Notice_Projection_Contract.v1.sop
@ [planning_coordination_pack] docs/planning/FSC2_Planning_Coordination_Pack.v1.sop
@ [runtime_graph_proof_pack] docs/planning/FSC3_Runtime_Graph_Proof_Pack.v1.sop

& [ManagerWorkerProjectionContractsV1] is the FSC4 contract set for manager and worker projections
  + [contract_id] is manager-worker-projection-contracts-v1
  + [contract_uuid] is 54ce3936-4dd2-4323-9c63-fe80a141ce75
  + [slice_id] is FSC4-S03
  + [authority_scope] is manager projection contract, worker packet projection contract, claim visibility rule, support and requirement delta visibility, false-ready prevention rule, and manager-worker action route contract
  + [implementation_scope] is projection contract only
  + [boundary_dependency] is docs/surfaces/FSC4_Surface_Boundary_And_Invariant_Map.v1.sop
  + [authority_notice_dependency] is docs/surfaces/Authority_Notice_Projection_Contract.v1.sop

  = must: let manager and worker surfaces show work state without becoming assignment or completion authority
  = must: preserve authority_notice, freshness, source lineage, claims, blockers, faults, and completion review state in every decision-making projection
  = must: route action requests through accepted operators, coordination review, SOP-first interrupt, human override, or completion review gates
  - never: implement UI components, dispatch jobs, assign agents, accept completion, or authorize operations in this contract

& [ManagerProjectionContract] is the manager-facing projection contract
  + [projection_kind] is manager_summary_projection
  + [required_input] is accepted_boundary_pack_ref
  + [required_input] is work_state_ref
  + [required_input] is readiness_projection_ref
  + [required_input] is work_packet_ref_set
  + [required_input] is coordination_claim_ref_set
  + [required_input] is support_delta_ref_set
  + [required_input] is requirement_delta_ref_set
  + [required_input] is completion_review_ref_set
  + [required_input] is fault_record_ref_set
  + [required_input] is stale_projection_ref_set
  + [required_input] is interrupt_context_ref_set
  + [required_output_field] is projection_id
  + [required_output_field] is authority_notice_ref
  + [required_output_field] is freshness_state
  + [required_output_field] is current_ready_slice_or_chunk
  + [required_output_field] is blocked_item_set
  + [required_output_field] is stale_item_set
  + [required_output_field] is contested_claim_set
  + [required_output_field] is fault_item_set
  + [required_output_field] is pending_review_set
  + [required_output_field] is supported_action_route_set
  + [forbidden_effect] is assignment
  + [forbidden_effect] is dispatch
  + [forbidden_effect] is completion acceptance
  + [forbidden_effect] is source authority mutation

  = must: show what is ready, blocked, stale, contested, faulted, interrupted, and pending review without opening gates itself
  = must: make every actionable recommendation traceable to accepted support and requirement records

& [WorkerPacketProjectionContract] is the worker-facing projection contract
  + [projection_kind] is worker_packet_projection
  + [required_input] is work_packet_ref
  + [required_input] is accepted_boundary_pack_ref_set
  + [required_input] is authority_basis_ref_set
  + [required_input] is dependency_set
  + [required_input] is verification_oracle_ref
  + [required_input] is model_route_ref
  + [required_input] is completion_review_requirement_ref
  + [required_input] is coordination_claim_ref_set
  + [required_input] is support_gap_ref_set
  + [required_input] is fault_record_ref_set
  + [required_output_field] is projection_id
  + [required_output_field] is authority_notice_ref
  + [required_output_field] is freshness_state
  + [required_output_field] is worker_scope_summary
  + [required_output_field] is accepted_input_ref_set
  + [required_output_field] is expected_output_ref_set
  + [required_output_field] is forbidden_scope_set
  + [required_output_field] is verification_oracle_summary
  + [required_output_field] is completion_review_required
  + [forbidden_effect] is claiming work
  + [forbidden_effect] is accepting completion
  + [forbidden_effect] is changing model route
  + [forbidden_effect] is silently expanding scope

  = must: show packet obligations and forbidden scope before work starts
  = must: route any claim, scope change, completion assertion, or model-route change through accepted coordination or completion review paths

& [ClaimVisibilityRule] is the claim visibility rule shared by manager and worker projections
  + [visible_claim_state] is unclaimed
  + [visible_claim_state] is claimed
  + [visible_claim_state] is contested
  + [visible_claim_state] is stale
  + [visible_claim_state] is released
  + [visible_claim_state] is superseded
  + [required_context] is claimant_ref
  + [required_context] is conversation_uuid
  + [required_context] is claim_scope_ref
  + [required_context] is claim_basis_ref_set
  + [required_context] is stale_after
  + [required_context] is conflict_ref_set

  = must: display contested and stale claims before a manager or worker projection offers action
  = must: route claim changes through coordination claim contracts, not through projection state

& [SupportRequirementDeltaVisibilityRule] is the support and requirement delta visibility rule
  + [visible_delta_kind] is support_delta
  + [visible_delta_kind] is requirement_delta
  + [visible_delta_kind] is unresolved_support_gap
  + [visible_delta_kind] is unresolved_requirement_change
  + [visible_delta_kind] is rebake_required
  + [visible_delta_kind] is no_rebake_required
  + [required_context] is delta_ref
  + [required_context] is affected_slice_or_chunk_ref
  + [required_context] is evidence_ref_set
  + [required_context] is completion_review_ref
  + [required_context] is stale_trigger_ref_set

  = must: surface support and requirement changes before next work is suggested
  = must: prevent false readiness when support or requirement deltas remain unreviewed

& [FalseReadyPreventionRule] is the false-ready prevention rule for manager and worker projections
  + [false_ready_condition] is missing authority_notice
  + [false_ready_condition] is missing freshness_state
  + [false_ready_condition] is stale boundary pack
  + [false_ready_condition] is unresolved support gap
  + [false_ready_condition] is unresolved requirement delta
  + [false_ready_condition] is contested coordination claim
  + [false_ready_condition] is missing completion review
  + [false_ready_condition] is hidden fault state
  + [false_ready_condition] is hidden interrupt state
  + [false_ready_condition] is forbidden scope mismatch
  + [required_output] is blocked_projection
  + [required_output] is stale_projection
  + [required_output] is fault_record
  + [required_output] is sop_first_interrupt_context

  = must: block ready display until every false-ready condition is cleared or explicitly reviewed
  = must: preserve false-ready evidence for FSC4 fixture planning

& [ManagerWorkerActionRouteContract] is the action route contract for manager and worker projections
  + [projection_action] is request_packet
  + [projection_action] is request_claim
  + [projection_action] is request_review
  + [projection_action] is request_rebake
  + [projection_action] is request_interrupt_resolution
  + [projection_action] is request_human_override
  + [allowed_route] is work_packet_generation contract
  + [allowed_route] is coordination_claim_register contract
  + [allowed_route] is coordination_conflict_signal contract
  + [allowed_route] is completion_review_delta_gate contract
  + [allowed_route] is SOPFirstInterruptResumeContractV1
  + [blocked_route] is manager projection opens gate directly
  + [blocked_route] is worker projection claims completion directly
  + [blocked_route] is projection dispatches an agent or machine job directly

  = must: emit action request records or interrupt context rather than mutate work authority
  = must: preserve projection carrier, actor, source_ref_set, and authority_notice in every action route

& [ManagerWorkerProjectionCoverageReview] is the FSC4-S03 coverage checklist
  + [manager_projection_contract_present] is ManagerProjectionContract
  + [worker_packet_projection_contract_present] is WorkerPacketProjectionContract
  + [claim_visibility_rule_present] is ClaimVisibilityRule
  + [support_requirement_delta_visibility_rule_present] is SupportRequirementDeltaVisibilityRule
  + [false_ready_prevention_rule_present] is FalseReadyPreventionRule
  + [manager_worker_action_route_contract_present] is ManagerWorkerActionRouteContract
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is UI implementation
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is agent assignment implementation
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is job dispatch implementation
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is completion acceptance implementation
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is adapter implementation
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is operations control

  = must: reject FSC4-S03 if manager or worker projections can assign, dispatch, accept completion, hide claims, hide deltas, or show false readiness
  = must: open FSC4-S04 only after this contract is accepted by completion review
